launchctl is the tool used to control and inspect daemons and agents.

* Agents are services started by the logged in user
* Daemons are services started by the system

They can be found under
/Library/LaunchAgents
/Library/LaunchDaemons
~/Library/LaunchAgents

launchctl list // this should list all daemons along with pid for those that are active and alive

launchctl remove com.annoying.servicename

